<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-108.2-generation-operations-grid-interaction-and-net-metering" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3457" name="W3457. Daily Generation Monitoring, SCADA &amp; Performance Surveillance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous (SCADA); daily operations
Frequency: Continuous + daily
Volume: ~80 commissioned solar sites today, growing toward the ~205-rooftop potential (per the README)
Owner: Energy Manager
Participants: Energy Manager, Facilities (links to VS-20.3), O&amp;M Vendor, BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3457 — Daily Generation Monitoring, SCADA &amp; Performance Surveillance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3457_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3457_Lane1" name="Energy Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3457_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3457_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3457_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3457_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3457_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3457_Start3" name="Continuous (SCADA); daily operations">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3457_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3457_Task4" name="Energy Manager/Facilities monitor generation via SCADA/monitoring platform…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Energy Manager/Facilities monitor generation via SCADA/monitoring platform: real-time kW/kWh, performance ratio, inverter status, alarms, and per-string performance across all sites; aggregate to portfolio view in BI (links to VS-28.1)
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / Facilities
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3457_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3457_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3457_Task5" name="Energy Manager detect and triage under-performance/anomalies (soiling, shading…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Energy Manager detect and triage under-performance/anomalies (soiling, shading, string/inverter fault, degradation) vs expected yield (W3456); prioritize by impact and dispatch O&amp;M (W3459) or warranty (W3460)
Responsible (R): Energy Manager
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3457_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3457_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3457_Task6" name="Energy Manager publish the daily/weekly generation and performance report…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Energy Manager publish the daily/weekly generation and performance report (actual vs expected, availability, faults), feed consumption-vs-generation matching (W3458) and net-metering settlement (W3463), and report portfolio performance to governance (W3471)
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / BI
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3457_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3457_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3457_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3457_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3457_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-135 (ensure renewable asset registration &amp; net-metering settlement.) | - operational: SCADA and anomaly detection; operational: smart alerting and prioritization
Owner: Energy Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3457_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3457_Annotation8" targetRef="W3457_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3457_Flow10" sourceRef="W3457_Start3" targetRef="W3457_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3457_Flow11" sourceRef="W3457_Task4" targetRef="W3457_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3457_Flow12" sourceRef="W3457_Task5" targetRef="W3457_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3457_Flow13" sourceRef="W3457_Task6" targetRef="W3457_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
