    <bpmn:process id="W_W3458" name="W3458. Self-Consumption Optimization &amp; Load Matching" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Generation/consumption analytics (W3457); tariff review
Frequency: Continuous + periodic optimization
Volume: All sites
Owner: Energy Manager
Participants: Energy Manager, Facilities (links to VS-20.3/VS-07), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Finance (links to VS-17)
Source: workflow W3458 — Self-Consumption Optimization &amp; Load Matching</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3458_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3458_Lane1" name="Energy Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3458_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3458_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3458_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3458_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3458_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3458_Start3" name="Generation/consumption analytics (W3457); tariff review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3458_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3458_Task4" name="Energy Manager/Analytics profile site load vs generation: consumption pattern…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Energy Manager/Analytics profile site load vs generation: consumption pattern (store/DC load, HVAC, lighting, refrigeration links to VS-20.3), generation curve, self-consumption ratio, and export volume; identify load-shifting and sizing opportunities
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / Analytics
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3458_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3458_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3458_Task5" name="Energy Manager/Facilities optimize self-consumption (highest-value use of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Energy Manager/Facilities optimize self-consumption (highest-value use of generated kWh): load-shifting (HVAC, water heating, charging) to solar hours, BESS charge/discharge scheduling (W3460), and avoidance of peak/grid import where tariffs penalize it; coordinate with store/DC ops (links to VS-07/VS-04)
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / Facilities
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3458_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3458_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3458_Task6" name="Energy Manager/Finance measure savings achieved (self-consumed kWh × avoided…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Energy Manager/Finance measure savings achieved (self-consumed kWh × avoided tariff + export kWh × export rate per W3463), validate against the business case (W3451), and tune the optimization as tariffs/load change; report to the performance review (W3471)
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3458_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3458_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3458_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3458_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3458_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-554 (ensure controlled execution — Generation Operations, Grid Interaction &amp; Net-Metering (PA-108.2).) | - operational: load-shifting and BESS; operational: coordination and guardrails
Owner: Energy Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3458_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3458_Annotation8" targetRef="W3458_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3458_Flow10" sourceRef="W3458_Start3" targetRef="W3458_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3458_Flow11" sourceRef="W3458_Task4" targetRef="W3458_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3458_Flow12" sourceRef="W3458_Task5" targetRef="W3458_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3458_Flow13" sourceRef="W3458_Task6" targetRef="W3458_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
