      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Grid outage/brownout (links to VS-07/W470); islanding capability
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: Sites with islanding/BESS capability
Owner: Energy Manager
Participants: Energy Manager, Facilities (links to VS-20.3), Store/DC Ops (links to VS-07/VS-04), HSE (links to VS-24)
Source: workflow W3461 — Grid Outage / Brownout Resilience &amp; Islanding Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3461_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3461_Lane1" name="Energy Manager">
