        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3461_Start4" name="Grid outage/brownout (links to VS-07/W470); islanding capability">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3461_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3461_Task5" name="Energy Manager/Facilities design islanding/resilience capability where…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Energy Manager/Facilities design islanding/resilience capability where justified: grid-forming inverter + BESS, critical-load prioritization (POS links to VS-08, lighting, refrigeration, safety), transfer/islanding logic, and compliance with DU/ERC anti-islanding rules (links to W3462)
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / Facilities / EPC
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: Per site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3461_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3461_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3461_Task6" name="During a grid outage, the system islands (if equipped) or the site falls back…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: During a grid outage, the system islands (if equipped) or the site falls back to generator/UPS (links to VS-07/W470); Facilities/Ops manage the switchover, confirm critical loads sustained, and coordinate with store/DC ops (links to VS-07/VS-04) and HSE (links to VS-24)
Responsible (R): Facilities / Store Ops / HSE
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: Event-driven</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3461_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3461_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3461_Task7" name="Energy Manager/Facilities validate post-outage grid reconnection and system…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Energy Manager/Facilities validate post-outage grid reconnection and system recovery, capture resilience performance (uptime sustained, kWh served), and report resilience value vs the business case (W3451) and BCP (links to VS-26); tune islanding logic
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / Facilities
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Event-driven</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3461_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3461_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3461_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3461_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
