    <bpmn:process id="W_W3462" name="W3462. ERC / DU Interconnection, Net-Metering Registration &amp; Compliance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Pre-energization (W3454); regulatory change
Frequency: Per site + on regulation change
Volume: All exporting/prosumer sites
Owner: Energy Manager
Participants: Energy Manager, Compliance/Regulatory (links to VS-22), Legal (links to VS-100.3), DU, ERC
Source: workflow W3462 — ERC / DU Interconnection, Net-Metering Registration &amp; Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3462_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3462_Lane1" name="Energy Manager">
