        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-135 (ensure renewable asset registration &amp; net-metering settlement.) | - operational: early application and DU relationship; operational: regulatory monitoring (links to VS-22)
Owner: Energy Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
