    <bpmn:process id="W_W3463" name="W3463. Net-Metering Settlement, Export Billing &amp; Import/Export Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly DU billing cycle; generation/consumption data (W3457)
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: All net-metered sites
Owner: Energy Manager
Participants: Energy Manager, Finance/AP (links to VS-15/VS-17), Facilities, DU
Source: workflow W3463 — Net-Metering Settlement, Export Billing &amp; Import/Export Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3463_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3463_Lane1" name="Energy Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3463_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3463_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3463_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3463_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3463_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3463_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3463_Start4" name="Monthly DU billing cycle; generation/consumption data (W3457)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3463_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3463_Task5" name="Energy Manager/Finance reconcile the monthly DU bill against SCADA/meter data…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Energy Manager/Finance reconcile the monthly DU bill against SCADA/meter data: import kWh (billed at retail tariff), export kWh (credited at export rate), net position, demand charges, and other charges; validate meter readings and rate application
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3463_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3463_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3463_Task6" name="Finance/AP process the net-metered electricity bill (links to VS-15.1/W7), post…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/AP process the net-metered electricity bill (links to VS-15.1/W7), post the electricity expense (reduced by self-generation) and export credit to GL (links to VS-17.1), and resolve billing disputes with the DU (links to VS-90/W244); allocate cost to the correct entity/site (links to VS-72)
Responsible (R): Finance / AP
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3463_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3463_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3463_Task7" name="Energy Manager/Finance compute the net savings (avoided import + export credit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Energy Manager/Finance compute the net savings (avoided import + export credit − charges vs baseline grid-only) per site and portfolio, validate against the business case (W3451) and optimization (W3458), and report to the performance review (W3471)
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3463_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3463_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3463_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3463_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3463_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-135 (ensure renewable asset registration &amp; net-metering settlement.) | - operational: reconciliation and dispute (links to VS-90); operational: self-consumption optimization (W3458)
Owner: Energy Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3463_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3463_Annotation9" targetRef="W3463_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
